Package: msbrowser
Title: Interactive LC–MS Data Exploration and Feature Analysis
Description: Provides a Shiny-based interface for interactive exploration of
    LC-MS data, with a focus on parameter tuning for xcms-based feature
    detection. Enables inspection of chromatographic and spectral data,
    including total and extracted ion chromatograms, and facilitates evaluation
    of how different parameter settings affect peak picking performance.
    Resulting feature tables and visualisations support method development,
    optimisation, and quality assessment of mass spectrometry experiments.
Version: 0.99.2
